  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796e715183b5afa14503f0a-63ca60c9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Cut tofu into bite-sized chunks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 mins (cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded). Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796e715183b5afa14503f0a-9a492992.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook zucchini and carrot, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir green curry powder and ginger paste, and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the soy sauce, and tofu, and cook until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796e715183b5afa14503f0a-3c348f79.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with tofu and veggie Thai green coconut curry to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6796e715183b5afa14503f0a-cc24d32d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
